[I] Python modules for JACK audio applications

[T] Zita-jacktools is a collection of Python modules to create JACK audio
[T] applications, such as audio players, recorders, level meters, matrix
[T] mixers, convolvers and signal generators, each running as a separate
[T] JACK client.

[U] https://kokkinizita.linuxaudio.org/linuxaudio/

